---
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import type { Locale } from '@/i18n/config';

const locale: Locale = 'en';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Contact Us"
  description="Get in touch with the tool.tl team. Send us feedback, report bugs, or request new tools."
  locale={locale}
  canonicalPath="contact"
>
  <h1>Contact Us</h1>

  <p>
    We value your feedback and are always looking to improve tool.tl. Whether you have a question,
    found a bug, want to suggest a new tool, or have a business inquiry, we'd love to hear from you.
  </p>

  <h2>Email</h2>
  <p>
    The fastest way to reach us is by email. We use a single inbox for all inquiries —
    general questions, bug reports, feature requests, and privacy concerns:
  </p>
  <p>
    <a href="mailto:support@tool.tl"><strong>support@tool.tl</strong></a>
  </p>

  <h2>Response Time</h2>
  <p>
    We aim to respond to all inquiries within 1–2 business days. For urgent technical issues,
    please include "URGENT" in your subject line and describe the problem in detail including
    which tool you were using and what browser/device you are on.
  </p>

  <h2>Feature Requests</h2>
  <p>
    Have an idea for a new tool or improvement? We prioritize features based on user demand.
    When suggesting a tool, it helps to include:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>What the tool should do.</li>
    <li>Why it would be useful (your use case).</li>
    <li>Any existing tools or references you've seen elsewhere.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Bug Reports</h2>
  <p>
    If you've encountered an issue, please include the following details to help us investigate:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Which tool you were using.</li>
    <li>What you expected to happen vs. what actually happened.</li>
    <li>Your browser and operating system.</li>
    <li>Any error messages you saw.</li>
  </ul>
</PageLayout>
